From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ombra engine maintainers <engine@ombra.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Edit guards, edit.run, edit.seenFromEditResults and
 edit.maxInputBytes

What: Edit guards, edit.run, edit.seenFromEditResults and edit.maxInputBytes
Why: Benchmark failure analysis showed edits silently deleting lines, re-reads after rejected or elided edits, an edit and its check costing two requests, and degenerate streamed edits running to the output limit. All are off by default; the Ombra harness turns them on.
Upstream-Status: Ombra-specific; not submitted

