+<system-injection>
+Your last turn stopped during a streamed `edit` call: its input passed {{limit}} bytes before the call completed, so the harness cut it off. Nothing was applied. This continuation replaces that turn.
+
+Re-issue the change as a short, well-formed `edit` that follows the tool's format exactly, with code only where the format puts it. Split a large change into several smaller edits, or use `write` to replace a whole file.
+
+Internal coding-agent auto-recovery after an oversized streaming edit, not a user instruction.
+</system-injection>
